                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A得意}嗯哼，这种理所当然的事情，\n那当然是哐哐呯呯哗啦哗啦地——",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990044_1947506361_content",
                "value": "{A得意}嗯哼，这种理所当然的事情，\n那当然是哐哐呯呯哗啦哗啦地——",
                "duration": null,
